  "title": "Rita's Sweet Holiday Baked Ham",
  "description": "This tasty Thanksgiving ham with pineapple, maraschino cherries, brown sugar, maple syrup, and orange juice is great for the holidays or any occasion.",
  "authors": [
    "AMOREFATA1972"
  ],
